{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":494028,"name":"Fatme Ulanova","username":"Fatme_Ulanova","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/f/6bbea6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T12:34:28.827Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494028-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494028-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBugbot / Security Review Agent\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494028-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494028-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIMPORTANT UPDATE:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also tried Reset Grok Bot’s Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe reset starts normally but gets stuck at approximately 50% during\u003cbr\u003e\n“Starting / Updating Grok Bot’s Computer”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt does not complete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis now looks similar to other reports where the Agent Computer was left\u003cbr\u003e\nin a partial / in-between backend state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do NOT delete or recreate my bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease manually recover / reprovision the Agent Computer on the backend\u003cbr\u003e\nwhile preserving my bots, conversations, files, integrations and routines.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI will not run Reset or Update again until support advises me to.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494028-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494028-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col start=\"11\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Settings → Updates.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRun Reset Grok Bot’s Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset progresses normally until approximately 50%.\u003c/li\u003e